OFF THE RECORD: AWAIT SUMMONS FROM leaves skipped messages for the next plain
OFF THE RECORD: AWAIT SUMMONS. A final timed wait exercises the timeout branch.

HEREINAFTER, patience SHALL MEAN 2.

ARTICLE 1.
    OFF THE RECORD: One mouse is much like another; the same filing serves for both.
    COMMENCE PROCEEDINGS UPON "FORM K-1. IN THE MATTER OF: one-of-the-folk. ARTICLE 1. AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER home. AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER voice. SERVE NOTICE OF voice UPON home. ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.", FILED UNDER mouse.
    COMMENCE PROCEEDINGS UPON "FORM K-1. IN THE MATTER OF: one-of-the-folk. ARTICLE 1. AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER home. AWAIT SUMMONS, FILED UNDER voice. SERVE NOTICE OF voice UPON home. ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.", FILED UNDER josephine.

ARTICLE 2.
