    SERVE NOTICE OF THE CASE AT BAR UPON josephine.
    SERVE NOTICE OF "piping, if not song" UPON josephine.

ARTICLE 3.
    OFF THE RECORD: The concert. Josephine is heard first, by name;
    OFF THE RECORD: the squeak, passed over, has lost nothing but its precedence.
    AWAIT SUMMONS FROM josephine, FILED UNDER song.
    PROCLAIM "first, whatever arrived first, Josephine: " PLUS song.
