    PROCLAIM "then the folk, in their turn: " PLUS squeak.

ARTICLE 4.
    OFF THE RECORD: Josephine vanishes, as she does. The folk await
    OFF THE RECORD: her voice once more, but the folk are practical.
    AWAIT SUMMONS FROM josephine FOR AT MOST patience DAYS, FILED UNDER encore. FAILING WHICH, REFER TO ARTICLE 5.
    PROCLAIM "an encore, against all precedent: " PLUS encore.
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.

ARTICLE 5.
